sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant Browser
  participant Next as Next.js
  participant Auth as Supabase Auth
  participant DB as Postgres/RLS

  User->>Browser: Sign in
  Browser->>Auth: Email + password + bot controls
  Auth-->>Browser: Secure session cookies via SSR flow
  Browser->>Next: Request portal
  Next->>Auth: Validate/refresh session
  Next->>DB: Load profile/roles under user session
  alt normal user
    DB-->>Next: own authorized data
  else privileged aal1
    Next-->>Browser: Require TOTP
    Browser->>Auth: Verify TOTP
    Auth-->>Browser: aal2 session
    Browser->>Next: Retry
    Next->>DB: DAL + RLS + aal2
    DB-->>Next: role-scoped data
  end
